message: >-
  If you refer to this work, please cite the paper. When the exact bytes of
  the formal development matter, also cite the archived Zenodo version.
title: >-
  Machine-Checked Dual-Write Recovery from a Committed Log: paper sources
  and Isabelle/HOL formal development
abstract: >-
  Information hub for the paper "Machine-Checked Dual-Write Recovery from a
  Committed Log." Contains the paper sources as posted to arXiv and the
  complete Isabelle/HOL development Dual_Write_Recovery, byte-identical to
  its archived Zenodo version 1.0 deposit.
